cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Occlusion-Aware Observations for Web Agents"
message: "If you use this software or benchmark, please cite it."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Pedapudi
    given-names: Bhargav
    alias: pedapudibhargav
abstract: >-
  Browser agents are given a list of named elements that cannot express
  occlusion, so a covered element is indistinguishable from a clickable one.
  This repository holds the measurement code, the four-arm ablation and a
  deterministic HAR benchmark for that finding.
keywords:
  - web agents
  - LLM agents
  - browser automation
  - accessibility tree
  - occlusion
  - Chrome DevTools Protocol
  - reproducible benchmark
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/pedapudibhargav/glance-occlusion"
